_pdbx_database_remark.id     99 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;Some fragments of disordered amino acids were built as
solvent(water) molecules with the following sequence
numbers: 106, 129, 165, 205, 206, 228, 251, 301, 309, 
316, 318, 328, 330, 351, 365, 400, 408, 423 and 466.
The water molecules 1, 2, 3, 4 are near the potassium
ion pathway inside molecule KcsA.
;
